+  - the tile columns move in from 16 to **20**: `cols = [cw − 20 − tw, floor4((cw − tw) / 2), 20]`. The column gaps become `(cw − 40 − 3·tw) / 2`: 16 at cw 720 and 780, 18-20 at 784 and 860 (was 20). **tw, th and A do not change**;
