+| **Hemicycle** | **O3 only**, ×4 (288×152) as the card's hero between the title band and the leader line (which becomes its caption). The fill is `seats[0:n]` in RTL order, n = the effective seats; it is drawn in the blackout too (it has no numeral, like the bar's fill). It is left out when the card would exceed the modal band; on the matrix that is only 375×548. **Row B keeps the bar on every device** (at ×2, 120 seats become 2-CSS dots, off the UI's whole-art-px grid). **Not on the result card O5:** a filled 120-seat arc beside a real leader is the TV poll graphic, on the image people forward out of context. That is barred by style guide §13 ("no seat numbers, ever") and the `poll-number` red line. It overrides the orchestrator's suggestion. |
